{"originalLanguage":"ko","title":"야생화","artist":"박효신","date":"2026-09-08","sourceId":"15101264:015","sourceHash":"0384a3854e9d159f3c359cfdebda454babcb6fea0ed2de02b6edfb869b78f969","duration":96.0,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":7.8,"end":13.44,"text":"한줄기 햇살에 몸 녹이다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":17.03,"end":23.143,"text":"그렇게 너는 또 한번 내게 온다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":26.01,"end":32.099,"text":"좋았던 기억만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":32.9,"end":38.93,"text":"그리운 마음만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":39.32,"end":44.463,"text":"니가 떠나간 그 길 위에","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":44.73,"end":50.07,"text":"이렇게 남아 서있다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":50.11,"end":55.23,"text":"잊혀질 만큼만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":55.27,"end":61.367,"text":"괜찮을 만큼만","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":62.1,"end":68.015,"text":"눈물 머금고 기다린 떨림 끝에","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":69.05,"end":75.049,"text":"다시 나를 피우리라","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":81.52,"end":87.386,"text":"사랑은 피고 또 지는 타버리는 불꽃","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}